<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 92,627.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks drop to 92,627.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of January 20 totaled 92,627 bales, down from 94,157 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no decertification orders, 1,530 cancellations, and 3,181 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640))</p>
</text>
